  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "flavor_text": "Ils se mettent à danser à la tombée\nde la nuit. Le Lakmécygne qui danse\nau centre est le chef de la troupe.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "black",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/17/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Swanna start to dance at dusk.\nThe one dancing in the middle is\nthe leader of the flock.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "black",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/17/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Ses coups de bec sont très efficaces.\nIl plie son long cou et en inflige un\ndouloureux enchaînement.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "white",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/18/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "It administers sharp, powerful pecks\nwith its bill. It whips its long neck to\ndeliver forceful repeated strikes.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "white",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/18/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Despite their elegant appearance,\nthey can flap their wings strongly\nand fly for thousands of miles.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "black-2",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/21/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Despite their elegant appearance,\nthey can flap their wings strongly\nand fly for thousands of miles.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "white-2",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/22/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "ゆうがな　みかけに　よらず\nつばさで　ちからづよく　はばたき\nすうせんキロ　とびつづけられる。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "우아한 외모와 다르게\n날개로 힘차게 날개 치며\n수천 km를 계속 날 수 있다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Un Pokémon gracieux, mais aussi robuste. Il peut\nvoler des milliers de kilomètres grâce à ses ailes\npuissantes.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Sie wirken zerbrechlich, aber ihre starken Schwingen\ntragen sie in einem Stück bis zu 1 000 km weit.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Aunque no lo parezca por su grácil elegancia, puede\nbatir con fuerza las alas y volar durante miles de\nkilómetros.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Non è solo elegante. Con il poderoso battito d’ali\nriesce a volare per migliaia di chilometri senza fermarsi.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Despite their elegant appearance, they can flap\ntheir wings strongly and fly for thousands of miles.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "優雅な　みかけに　よらず\n翼で　力強く　羽ばたき\n数千キロ　飛び続けられる。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
